       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day under supervision. The usual OTC limit is 1,200 mg/day. At this dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,600 mg/day total**, divided into a different schedule\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly and I'll enter it with a note recording that it's an intentional above-maximum dose. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
